    "comment": {
      "comments": [
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12388295/comment/12599617",
          "id": "12599617",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=sberlin",
            "name": "sberlin",
            "key": "sberlin",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Sam Berlin",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "Along with these visibility fixes, I think some attention should be placed on classes who shared their variables directly (as opposed to through a getter).  This is sometimes OK for subclasses, but rarely good for other classes that use the objects.  There's a small number of classes that have non-private variables, especially in the impl.conn & impl.conn.tsccm packages.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=sberlin",
            "name": "sberlin",
            "key": "sberlin",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Sam Berlin",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "created": "2008-05-24T20:04:02.447+0000",
          "updated": "2008-05-24T20:04:02.447+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12388295/comment/12599626",
          "id": "12599626",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=sebb",
